                "category": "summary",
                "text": "NVIDIA has released a software update for NVIDIA\u00ae ChatRTX. To protect your system, download and install this software update from the <a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/ai-on-rtx/chatrtx/\">ChatRTX Download</a> page.",
